  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Calamine,&nbsp;Siderite&nbsp;and&nbsp;Malachite are carbonate containing ores.&nbsp;Sphalerite is a sulphide ore.</p><p>Calamine: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>ZnCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>Siderite: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>Sphalerite : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnS</mi></math></p><p>Malachite : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>",
